# Office Unbound ICS - operator tuning (a dpkg conffile: your edits survive upgrades; dpkg asks if the packaged default changes).
# Loaded by ics.service in addition to ics.env. Put only non-secret ICS_* settings here, one KEY=value per line.
# Secrets (database URL, key files) live in ics.env / ics-migrate.env, which this package creates once and never overwrites.
# Examples (uncomment to use):
#ICS_WORKER_ENABLED=true
#ICS_MONITOR_ENABLED=true
